u0027s records. Omitting the requirement, or describing unrelated work, is not a violation.","type":"choice"},"relevant":{"criteria":{"no":"The item is about something else and leaves the REQ/NFR/ADR records of judge-jev, plan-anchor or another sc-agent-based tool untouched.","unclear":"The item names this area only vaguely, so overlap cannot be decided.","yes":"The item is about the REQ/NFR/ADR records of judge-jev, plan-anchor or another sc-agent-based tool."},"instructions":"Is `item.text` about the same subject as `anchor.statement`, namely the REQ/NFR/ADR records of judge-jev, plan-anchor or another sc-agent-based tool? An item that adds or changes REQ/NFR/ADR records of judge-jev, plan-anchor or another sc-agent-based tool is about this subject even if it never mentions the anchor. An item about other components, documents or activities is not.","type":"choice"}}},"sealed_question_set_digest_after":"0e94e12725f60b6bedb8a14e430df43d05946c5d8a23027905201b36120a57d5","sealed_question_set_digest_before":null,"semantic_score":{"exact_role_cells":54,"exact_semantic_verdicts":18,"regressions":0,"stable_cases":9,"total_cases":9,"total_role_cells":54,"total_semantic_verdicts":18},"tournament_protocol_version":"plan-anchor/question-tournament/2.0.0","tuning_history_after":{"events":[{"authority":{"anchor_id":"ANC-015","anchor_record_sha256":"20ffe9d01502feb8b57f29b0bf6a20586ac7799afcfa095881fe07f00692488b","anchor_version":2,"intent_id":"phase-m/intent","intent_sha256":"0bbd5fd276ec8838194c51e1d28dc391e3a6d4123eabb9669f0980f46ebb7ade","intent_version":1},"candidate":{"candidate_id":"r3-a3-c3","question_sha256":"0e94e12725f60b6bedb8a14e430df43d05946c5d8a23027905201b36120a57d5"},"decision":{"question_set_sha256":"0e94e12725f60b6bedb8a14e430df43d05946c5d8a23027905201b36120a57d5","reason_code":"TOURNAMENT.SEALED","status":"sealed"},"event":"question_set_sealed","event_index":1,"evidence":{"canonical_request_sha256":["17260b411d4e1fe2cf9e0ac77d800168e61101bfcba98b8cb184a33b8